ial bottlenecks of RNNs and the limitations of convolution-based approaches. The Transformer delivers better translation quality, faster training, and improved parallelization, establishing a new direction for natural language processing research."}, "predicted": "Successfully write contents to /testbed/data/abstract.docx", "actual": "Successfully write contents to /testbed/data/abstract.docx"}
